<title>SOUTH KOREA: Bank of Korea mulls buying dollars.</title>
<headline>Bank of Korea mulls buying dollars.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank wants the dollar to strengthen against the won and is considering dollar-buying interventions, a Bank of Korea (BOK) official said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
